OL,3,ADon't Stop Believin'! - high school
OL,4,Amusical Glee set for reboot
OL,5,
OL,6,FWe never stopped believin'... now it's
OL,7,Fofficial: Glee, the Emmy-winning US
OL,8,Fhigh school musical comedy drama, is
OL,9,Fset to return.
OL,11,FRyan Murphy's series, which chronicled
OL,12,Fthe highs and lows of choir members
OL,13,Ffrom Ohio, premiered on Fox in 2009 and
OL,14,Fran for six seasons until 2015.
OL,16,FThe original cast included Lea Michele,
OL,17,FAmber Riley, the late Cory Monteith,
OL,18,FJane Lynch and Matthew Morrison as Will
OL,19,FSchuester, the optimistic teacher
OL,20,Fleading the fictional McKinley High's
OL,21,Fglee club.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/20
