OL,3,AAli G is back. But is the character
OL,4,Apast its sell-by date?
OL,5,
OL,6,F"This is the biggest gathering of
OL,7,Fcultural appropriators in history,"
OL,8,FSacha Baron Cohen tells the camera in
OL,9,Fhis parody of a street accent.
OL,11,FBehind him, hundreds of fans cram onto
OL,12,Fa London Underground escalator, all
OL,13,Fwearing Ali G's trademark yellow shell
OL,14,Fsuit and skullcap. Baron Cohen shouts
OL,15,Fthe character's catchphrases through a
OL,16,Fmegaphone, with the crowd
OL,17,Fenthusiastically finishing each one.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/20
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
